# pdfFiller

> pdfFiller is a cloud-based document management platform for editing, completing, eSigning, and sharing PDFs and fillable forms. It runs in any browser plus native iOS and Android apps, requires no software install, and provides a library of 35M+ fillable templates. pdfFiller is independently certified for HIPAA, SOC 2 Type II, GDPR, CCPA, and PCI-DSS, and is part of airSlate.
pdfFiller serves individuals, small businesses, and enterprises across healthcare, legal, real estate, finance, and HR. Core capabilities span PDF editing, legally binding eSignatures (ESIGN, UETA, eIDAS), document conversion, OCR for scanned files, AI-powered document tools, fillable-form building, and secure cloud storage. Pricing is Basic $8/mo, Plus $12/mo, and Premium $15/mo (billed annually), with a 30-day free trial. A REST API (PDF Tools API) exposes the same editing, conversion, and signing capabilities to developers.

